# Conformance probe pack for presence bits named inside cases (spec 0.20,
# ruling 21), most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   presence p 8
#   x : 8, then by x
#     1     if p.1: y : 8
#     2     opt [ if p.2: z : 8 ]
#     else  nothing
#   opt [ if p.3: w : 8 ]
#
# An `if` naming p counts for ruling 1 of 0.8 only when the innermost case
# it sits in is the one read; an `if` in no case counts as before (ruling 17
# of 0.8), also inside a block that is not read.
format     conformance-kinds-pres
version    0.20.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
presence p 8
field  probe.x  8  uint
switch probe.x
  case 1
    if p.1
      field  probe.y  8  uint
    end
  case 2
    opt
      if p.2
        field  probe.z  8  uint
      end
    end
  else
end
opt
  if p.3
    field  probe.w  8  uint
  end
end
